   "slippage_ticks": 0.0,
   "include_spread": true
  },
  "rationale": "Example only. The mechanism was REJECTED in docs/FAILED_REVERSAL_REPLICATION.md - QQQ inverts its sign on the same index. It is used here purely to exercise the engine.",
  "notes": {}
 },
